      "side": 1,
      "message": "After I modified cli_test.cc, the test CliTest.ParseValidArguments failed with a segmentation fault (core dumped).\nIf I comment out argv.push_back(nullptr), FileSizesAndAlignments/FileControlParamTest.ValidatesFileHandling/Aligned4Bytes fails.",
